CACTIxT RELEASE v1.0.0 SOFTWARE LICENSE

CACTIxT is a CACTI-compatible SRAM architectural modeling framework derived
in part from the CACTI source code and from the FinCACTI/PCACTI source code,
with additional modifications and extensions developed for CACTIxT.

