FinCACTI/PCACTI-derived portions

FinCACTI/PCACTI was developed by:
Alireza Shafaei, Yanzhi Wang, Xue Lin, and Massoud Pedram,
Department of Electrical Engineering,
University of Southern California.

Reference:
A. Shafaei, Y. Wang, X. Lin, and M. Pedram,
"FinCACTI: Architectural Analysis and Modeling of Caches with
Deeply-Scaled FinFET Devices,"
2014 IEEE Computer Society Annual Symposium on VLSI (ISVLSI),
pp. 290-295, 2014.

Original copyright notices, license notices, and disclaimer statements
contained in FinCACTI/PCACTI source files remain applicable to the
corresponding portions of this software and must be retained.

